new file mode 100644
index 0000000..b64488a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/tests/priority_tool/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@
+# Priority client host checks
+
+The production freestanding client runs against a syscall model, never real host
+UID-changing calls. Tests enforce namespace isolation/private mounts before ID
+changes, complete group/UID dropping, read-only probes, invalid-only scheduling
+validation, unsupported-command sentinels, correct JSON/exit states, and every
+failure before dropping IDs. Negative controls must detect removing mount privacy,
+sending a valid scheduling update, accepting an unanswered ABI command, or
+rejecting SDK sandbox callers through an ordinary-app-only UID gate. Successful
+probes include ordinary, SDK sandbox and app-zygote caller IDs.
